  <item>
    <title>Vol.5 涂鸦 | Still Writin主理人DENS专访</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63caa275531dadd2b16de87e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63caa275531dadd2b16de87e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 20 Jan 2023 14:17:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>KICKOFF S01E05</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们邀请到了Still Writin的主理人登（DENS）。Still Writin是西南地区首家涂鸦工具仓库和涂鸦文化推广平台，登本人也有超过10年的涂鸦经验。今天我们通过跟登的聊天，来带大家了解一下什么是街头涂鸦。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnj1SkmtnPm8LdnqdguR2Cj48lWc.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Still Writin店门口，有来自德国的涂鸦大神“Cantwo"的作品</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgojxMNZZlfU4PWMzwzRnx5xpKvj.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lovriz3w7VL2DF9KinU6MJb_8zFc.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loAMK8UhDv7qOWw_0PiVhXj7EMqZ.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnMOlyK60IbgsrWlDLYAcvk7Y5RS.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">1:48</a> DENS是从什么时候开始接触涂鸦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="281">4:41</a> 涂鸦圈的聚会是什么样, 国际涂鸦聚会meeting of style</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">5:48</a> 涂鸦的定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">8:10</a> 什么是“whole train”，早期美国的涂鸦为什么喜欢画火车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">10:13</a> 涂鸦的一些专用名词：tag, t-up(throw up), bomb, piece, mural都是什么意思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="823">13:43</a> 涂鸦文化什么时候进的中国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">17:22</a> 涂鸦需要有绘画基础吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1209">20:09</a> 深夜“炸街”遇见城管，怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1545">25:45</a> 过去几年rapper们都走起来了，涂鸦者们靠什么赚钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1776">29:36</a> 从涂鸦破圈的KAWS</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1931">32:11</a> 涂鸦圈另外一位要说的人：Banksy</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2268">37:48</a> 涂鸦者如何处理“beef”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">48:40</a> 涂鸦者有哪些共性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3044">50:44</a> 对新手涂鸦者的建议</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgnQGHLW9zMF0scyYbFsqaWZEBE8.m4a" length="85982920" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpUTX7EvsEHDBdda4OEll2_apPL9.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
